31941::$$$message_0252_0000_0000$$$::Let's go back.[lr]::
31942::$$$message_0252_0000_0001$$$::There will be other nights. We can come back tomorrow.::
31943::$$$message_0252_0001_0000$$$::"Let's leave it here for tonight. I'll come get you when I plan to go patrol again. Thanks, Saber."[lr]::
31944::$$$message_0252_0001_0001$$$::"All right. I'm happy to help."::
31945::$$$message_0252_0002_0000$$$::We go home together.[lr]::
31946::$$$message_0252_0002_0001$$$::There's still plenty of time until tomorrow.::
931943::$$$message_9252_0001_0000$$$::"Let's leave it here for tonight. I'll come get you when I plan to go patrol again. Thanks, Saber."[r]::

